Package: CaImagingAnalysisFr
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive Calcium Imaging Analysis Tools
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kevin", "J", email = "kevin@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Calcium Team", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for calcium imaging analysis including
    background correction, spike inference, cell segmentation, motion correction,
    neuropil correction, cross-session cell registration, and stimulus-aligned
    analysis. Provides modern R-native features: S7 classes for type safety,
    data.table integration for large trace operations, Rcpp-accelerated hot paths,
    future/furrr parallelization, formula-based analysis interface, custom ggplot2
    geoms for calcium imaging visualization, Arrow/DuckDB backend for out-of-core
    processing, and classical machine learning methods (random forests, gradient
    boosting, SVMs, regularized regression) for cell classification, neural
    decoding, and event detection.
